/*	Resources linked into every PC exe (port/CMakeLists.txt sbsp_exe_link):
	the application manifest, sbsp.manifest (issue #62).

	Language neutral (0, 0) on purpose.  MinGW links default-manifest.o
	into every exe, which carries a manifest at the same type/name/language
	(RT_MANIFEST 1, language 0); binutils' resource merge drops that
	default one when the link supplies its own at the same slot, so the
	exe ends up with exactly one.  clang-cl links with /MANIFEST:NO so
	lld-link adds none of its own.
*/
LANGUAGE 0, 0

1 24 "sbsp.manifest"	/* CREATEPROCESS_MANIFEST_RESOURCE_ID, RT_MANIFEST */
